  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A solid cylinder of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> is released from rest on an inclined plane. The cylinder rolls without slipping.</p>\n<p>The moment of inertia of the cylinder is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}mr^{2}\"></span>. The speed when it reaches the bottom of the inclined plane is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the vertical height from which the cylinder was released?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v^{2}}{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3v^{2}}{4g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v^{2}}{2g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v^{2}}{4g}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
